      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "For the Respondent : Mrs. Priya Shrestha, Special P.P.\n ---\n6/07.05.2025 I. A. No. 10195 of 2024:\nHeard Mr. Vikash Kumar, learned counsel appearing for the appellant and Mrs. Priya Shrestha,\nlearned Special P.P. appearing for the State.\nThis interlocutory application has been preferred by the appellant for grant of bail to him during the pendency of this appeal.\nThe appellant has been convicted for the offences under Sections 366 A, 376(3) of I.P.C. and Section 6 of the POCSO Act and has been sentenced to undergo rigorous imprisonment for 20 years along with a fine of Rs. 10,000/- for the offence under Section 6 of the POCSO Act.\nIt has been alleged that the appellant had enticed away the daughter of the informant.",
